  Fixture with invented data in the structure of a DFS AIXM 5.1.1 service dataset.
  Includes the cases the importer has to survive: a unit-provided service, callsigns in two
  languages, a service serving an airspace, one serving an airport, a duplicate frequency and
  a service whose channel reference cannot be resolved.

  Every identifier, name, frequency and position here is invented. Only the structure
  follows the published format, so the importers can be tested without reproducing any
  part of a DFS dataset.
-->
